OL,3,ANew right to bereavement leave to cover
OL,4,Astep and half relatives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new legal right to unpaid time off
OL,7,Fwork after suffering a bereavement will
OL,8,Fcover step and half relatives, as well
OL,9,Fas foster, kinship care and adoptive
OL,10,Frelationships, the government has said.
OL,12,FFrom April next year, employees in
OL,13,FGreat Britain who lose a spouse,
OL,14,Fpartner, parent, adult child or sibling
OL,15,Fwill be entitled to up to two weeks'
OL,16,Funpaid leave.
OL,18,FThe government had already confirmed
OL,19,Fthe new rights will also apply to
OL,20,Fparents who experience a miscarriage
OL,21,Fbefore 24 weeks of pregnancy.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
