OL,3,ANew right to bereavement leave to cover
OL,4,Astep and half relatives
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreviously only parents who have lost a
OL,7,Fchild aged under 18 or stillborn from
OL,8,F24 weeks had a legal right to
OL,9,Fbereavement leave.
